{
  "id": "20002099",
  "group": "20000001",
  "order_index": 3,
  "title": "Apotheosis",
  "subtitle": "Gear affixes, gems, and enchanting overhaul",
  "icon": "apotheosis:gem_cutting_table",
  "default_quest_shape": "hexagon",
  "quests": [
    {
      "id": "2000205E",
      "title": "Affix Gear Drops",
      "subtitle": "Find and Equip Affix Gear",
      "description": [
        "Every weapon, tool, and armor piece in Apotheosis rolls with rarity and affixes.",
        "Rarity determines gem sockets — Common (white, 0 sockets), Uncommon (yellow, 1), Rare (cyan, 2), Epic (purple, 3), Mythic (gold, 4)",
        "Affixes are random stat bonuses: Ruthless (+crit damage and chance on weapons), Sturdy (+armor and knockback resist on armor), Nimble (+movement and attack speed on boots and leggings)",
        "Mekanism Tools and Simply Swords weapons ALL roll with Apotheosis affixes",
        "Check every single drop — a Common helmet with a great affix can outperform an Epic with useless stats."
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:diamond_sword",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "shape": "hexagon",
      "dependencies": [],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "2000205C",
          "type": "checkmark",
          "value": 1
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "id": "2000205D",
          "type": "xp_levels",
          "xp_levels": 3
        }
      ],
      "optional": false
    },
    {
      "id": "20002062",
      "title": "Scrap to Upgrade",
      "subtitle": "Salvaging Table and Gem Dust",
      "description": [
        "The Salvaging Table destroys unwanted gear and produces Gem Dust — the currency of Apotheosis gem crafting.",
        "Dust tiers: Rough Dust (from Common and Uncommon gear), Iron Dust, Diamond Dust, Emerald Dust (from higher rarities)",
        "Salvage ALL gear you do not want — even white Common junk from mob farms",
        "Dump mob farm output into a chest next to your Salvaging Table and process in batches",
        "Gem Dust accumulates for cutting and upgrading gems."
      ],
      "icon": "apotheosis:salvaging_table",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1,
      "shape": "hexagon",
      "dependencies": [
        "2000205E"
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "2000205F",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "apotheosis:salvaging_table",
          "count": 1,
          "consume_items": false
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
