          "count": 8,
          "reward_table_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "optional": false
    },
    {
      "id": "20002066",
      "title": "First Gem",
      "subtitle": "Cut and Socket Your First Gem",
      "description": [
        "Gems are socketable, permanent stat boosts.",
        "Three tiers: Rough gems (drop from mobs and chests, basic stats)",
        "Cut gems (Rough + Gem Dust at Cutting Station, +50% stat value)",
        "Flawless gems (two Cut gems combined at Cutting Station, +100% stat value — quadruple Rough)",
        "Socket gems at the Gem Socketing Table — place gear in top slot, gem in a socket",
        "Priority: get your main weapon's gem to Flawless before socketing anything else."
      ],
      "icon": "apotheosis:gem",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2,
      "shape": "hexagon",
      "dependencies": [
        "20002062"
      ],
      "tasks": [
