          "xp_levels": 1
        }
      ],
      "optional": true
    },
    {
      "id": "20002070",
      "title": "Affix Synergies",
      "subtitle": "Stack Same-Type for Exponential Returns",
      "description": [
        "Affixes of the same category stack multiplicative bonuses.",
        "Titanic (+max HP) on chestplate plus Sturdy (+armor) on leggings creates a tank build",
        "Nimble (+speed) on boots plus Ruthless (+crit) on weapon creates a speed-crit build",
        "Build your affix combination around your weapon type — fast weapons want on-hit effects, slow weapons want single-burst damage."
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:iron_chestplate",
      "x": 1.5,
      "y": 1,
      "shape": "square",
      "dependencies": [],
      "tasks": [
        {
