    },
    {
      "id": "20002077",
      "title": "Tiered Bookshelves",
      "subtitle": "Hellshelf, Seashelf, Endshelf",
      "description": [
        "Apotheosis removes the vanilla enchanting level cap entirely.",
        "Sharpness VIII, Protection VIII, Fortune V, Looting V are now achievable",
        "Tiered bookshelves enable these higher levels: Hellshelf (crafted with nether materials, enables mid-tier levels)",
        "Seashelf (ocean materials)",
        "Endshelf (End materials, enables maximum levels)",
        "Place around your Enchanting Table exactly like regular bookshelves — the table GUI updates to show available enchantment levels beyond 30."
      ],
      "icon": "apotheosis:hellshelf",
      "x": 3,
      "y": 0,
      "shape": "hexagon",
