    {
      "id": "2000207F",
      "title": "Gem Mastery",
      "subtitle": "Socket a Flawless Gem",
      "description": [
        "Two Cut gems of the same type combined at the Cutting Station produce one Flawless gem — 100 percent stat value, quadruple a Rough gem.",
        "A Flawless crit gem in a Lifesteal weapon is extreme DPS with sustain",
        "A Flawless HP gem in your chestplate lets you survive boss mechanics that would otherwise one-shot you",
        "Gems are what separate a struggling Phase 2 player from a boss-farming Phase 3 demigod",
        "Priority: Flawless on your weapon first, chestplate second."
      ],
      "icon": "apotheosis:gem",
      "x": 3,
      "y": 2,
      "shape": "hexagon",
      "dependencies": [
        "20002066"
      ],
