      "id": "2000208A",
      "title": "Enchantment Library Combos",
      "subtitle": "Auto-Merge and Discover",
      "description": [
        "The Library of Alexandria auto-merges duplicate enchantment books constantly.",
        "Two Sharpness IV books become one Sharpness V without player interaction",
        "Two Protection IV become Protection V",
        "Check the Library periodically — you will find max-level enchants you did not realize were ready",
        "The Library is the most time-saving block in Apotheosis."
      ],
