      "id": "2000208D",
      "title": "Salvage Automation",
      "subtitle": "Auto-Process Mob Farm Gear",
      "description": [
        "Connect a Mekanism pipe or Create funnel to your Salvaging Table input face.",
        "Feed it from your mob farm output chest",
        "All unwanted Common through Rare gear automatically processes into Gem Dust without player interaction",
        "Gem Dust routes into AE2 storage — always available for gem cutting on demand",
        "Zero player time spent salvaging."
      ],
