      "id": "20002091",
      "title": "Mythic Arsenal",
      "subtitle": "Full Mythic Set with 4 Flawless Gems",
      "description": [
        "Complete Mythic gear set (helmet, chestplate, leggings, boots) plus weapon, all with maximum 4 Flawless gems socketed per piece and maximum-level enchants applied.",
        "This is the Apotheosis ceiling — the highest tier of gear the mod produces",
        "Salvage everything Rare and below on sight",
        "Only Epic pieces are worth inspecting for potential upgrades",
        "Mythic drop hunting from affixed Cataclysm and Aether bosses is your primary activity."
      ],
