    {
      "id": "20002095",
      "title": "Perfect Roll",
      "subtitle": "Mythic Weapon with Ideal Affixes",
      "description": [
        "Even at Mythic tier, affixes still roll randomly.",
        "A Perfect Roll is a Mythic weapon where every affix slot contains the ideal stat for your build — Ruthless (+crit), Titanic (+max HP), and Nimble (+attack speed) for a speed-crit build",
        "This is the true endgame loot chase in Apotheosis",
        "Every affixed Cataclysm boss, Aether guardian, and Twilight Forest boss killed is one more chance at perfection",
        "The odds are astronomical",
        "The hunt never ends."
      ],
