      "id": "20002098",
      "title": "Deadly Module Traps",
      "subtitle": "High Risk Dungeon Hazards",
      "description": [
        "Apotheosis Deadly Module adds telegraphed traps to dungeons: spike pits (visible pressure plates), poison dart walls, lava rooms, insta-kill drop chambers.",
        "The deadliest trap rooms hold the best loot",
        "Traps are avoidable — watch for tripwires, suspicious chests, and unusual block placement",
        "GraveStone preserves your items if you misstep."
